    {
      "_id": "K1dZFdNyISxrbD8E",
      "name": "Metamagic (2/Day)",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/item-bag.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The mage can use metamagic to twist its spells with one of the following effects: <em> <strong><em>Distant Spell.</em></strong> The mage can use its metamagic when it casts a spell that has a range of 5 feet or greater to double the range of the spell. </em> <strong><em>Empowered Spell.</em></strong> The mage can use its metamagic when it rolls damage for a spell to reroll up to 4 damage dice. It must then use the new damage rolls.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
